# Lessons learned

Institutional memory lives in **`lessons.md`** at each git repo root (append-only). Procedure is defined in:

- **Planner:** `.cursor/agents/planner.md` — read before planning
- **Implementer:** `.cursor/skills/execute-plan/SKILL.md` — skim before large edits
- **Reviewer:** `.cursor/skills/review-diff/SKILL.md` — append MEDIUM/HIGH findings

Do not delete or rewrite past entries unless the user explicitly asks.
